      "writtenOn": "2026-05-31T12:06:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This directly calls `ThreadLocalRequestContext#getContext()`, which may be `null` outside an HTTP request scope.\n\nAs a possible improvement, I uploaded a small follow-up change 589261 that uses `Provider\u003cRequestContext\u003e` for the current-user lookup instead.\n\nIf you think that approach makes sense, we could squash it into this change.",
