      "writtenOn": "2026-05-31T12:06:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This manual copy should document its contract, similar to the comment in  `ActionJson#copy()`.\n\nOtherwise future ServerInfo fields may be added to `GetServerInfo#apply` but forgotten here.\n\n```suggestion\n  private static ServerInfo copyServerInfo(ServerConfigData cachedConfig) {\n    // Include all fields from GetServerInfo#apply except download. DownloadInfo\n    // may be user-specific, so identified-user requests replace it below.\n```\n\nIt would also be useful to add focused coverage that representative cached fields survive this path while download is replaced. Similarly how it was done in ActionsIT tests, e.g.:\n\n```\n    changeActionVisitor()\n    currentRevisionActionVisitor()\n    oldRevisionActionVisitor()\n```\n\nSee my suggestion to add one small test.",
